1 CONT Shirin Beloved wife of Khosrau 
1 CONT Chosroes and Shirin A Persian love story depicting a ménage à trois between Khosrau and Shirin as king and queen, and Farhad as Shirin's lover 
1 CONT Barbad Khosrau's favorite court musician 
1 CONT Shabdiz Khosrau's highly admired horse 
