1 CONT Edward Walford, translator, The Ecclesiastical History of Evagrius: A History of the Church from AD 431 to AD 594, 1846. Reprinted 2008. Evolution Publishing, ISBN 978-1-889758-88-6. [1] — a primary source containing detailed info
1 CONC rmation about the early reign of Khosrau II and his relationship with the Romans. 
1 CONT
